{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794532196060,"sessionID":"ses_e2d8e5252ffeattb2EUQkGXt4x","part":{"partID":"prt_1d274398a002pHFLfAeG5J17VI","sessionID":"ses_e2d8e5252ffeattb2EUQkGXt4x","messageID":"msg_1d2742587001vZrz8QeBk8X138","type":"tool","id":"call_9b0e5dab73b04f5282ae57a2","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md","oldString":"| `sync-gate1-pointers.cjs` | Writes the Gate 1 lookup pointer block into `.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md` from the root `AGENTS.md` line. Codex reads the root file as project instructions and needs no block; `--check` reports drift without writing. |","newString":"| `sync-gate1-pointers.cjs` | Writes two pointer blocks into `.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md` from the root `AGENTS.md` lines: the Gate 1 lookup, and the Gate 2 command rule with its direct advisor call. Codex reads the root file as project instructions and needs no block; `--check` reports drift without writing. |"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md\n@@ -22,9 +22,9 @@\n | File | Responsibility |\n |---|---|\n | `command-scope.cjs` | Authored exceptions for runtime-exclusive commands and runtime-native commands. |\n | `sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs` | Derives expected mirror links, checks drift and writes missing or stale links when invoked without `--check`. Its `dsh-adapters` tree expects one link in `.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/` per `.mjs` adapter in a `.skilled/hooks/<concern>/dsh/` folder, aimed at the adapter's real file. |\n-| `sync-gate1-pointers.cjs` | Writes the Gate 1 lookup pointer block into `.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md` from the root `AGENTS.md` line. Codex reads the root file as project instructions and needs no block; `--check` reports drift without writing. |\n+| `sync-gate1-pointers.cjs` | Writes two pointer blocks into `.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md` from the root `AGENTS.md` lines: the Gate 1 lookup, and the Gate 2 command rule with its direct advisor call. Codex reads the root file as project instructions and needs no block; `--check` reports drift without writing. |\n | `hook-registry.json` | The canonical hook set: every hook once, with its concern, script and per-runtime event bindings; Pi's entry file name per hook. |\n | `sync-hook-registrations.cjs` | Renders the four JSON hook registration files from the registry in each runtime's shape and verifies the Pi entry files, each a one-line re-export; `--check` reports drift without writing. |\n \n ---\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/README.md\",\"oldString\":\"| `sync-gate1-pointers.cjs` | Writes the Gate 1 lookup pointer block into `.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md` from the root `AGENTS.md` line. Codex reads the root file as project instructions and needs no block; `--check` reports drift without writing. |\",\"newString\":\"| `sync-gate1-pointers.cjs` | Writes two pointer blocks into `.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md` from the root `AGENTS.md` lines: the Gate 1 lookup, and the Gate 2 command rule with its direct advisor call. Codex reads the root file as project instructions and needs no block; `--check` reports drift without writing. |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794532194698,"end":1794532196060}}}}
